<Seo Canonical="/docs/extensions/pdf/api" Title="Blazorise PDF API" Description="Explore the Blazorise PDF API reference for declarative document components, fluent document building, PDF generation, and resource limits." />

<DocsPageTitle Path="Extensions/PDF/API">
    Blazorise PDF API
</DocsPageTitle>

<DocsPageLead>
    Review the components, builders, services, and options used to define and generate PDF documents.
</DocsPageLead>

<DocsPageParagraph>
    For setup instructions and examples, see the <Anchor To="docs/extensions/pdf">PDF documentation</Anchor>.
</DocsPageParagraph>

